    <name>Hridsko Lake</name>
    <desc>A short and easy 3,7 km trail in Prokletije National Park. It leads mostly downhill, with a total descent of 356 m, and is suitable for hikers of all experience levels. Route data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Elevation produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved.</desc>
